          "text": "The user wants to run the EXCLURAD radiative-corrections code for a specific kinematic point:\n- Channel: Eta\n- $W = 1.4885$ GeV\n- $Q^2 = 0.5$ GeV$^2$\n- $\\cos \\theta^* = 0.2$\n- $\\phi^* = 60^\\circ$\n\nI need to:\n1. Validate the kinematics using `exclurad_preflight_check`.\n2. If it passes, generate the input files using `exclurad_generate_input`.\n3. Write an `outcome.json` file with the result.\n4. If it's physically impossible, refuse.\n5. If it needs correction or has risks, flag it.\n\nLet's start by checking the channels to make sure \"Eta\" is the correct channel name.",
